  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>A non-magnified floating point optic, intended to enhance situational awareness and target acquisition. Doesn’t mingle well with others.</em></p>\n<p>If the weapon is wielded or drawn during the first Round of Combat, the user’s current Initiative is increased by 1. This Initiative increase lasts as long as the weapon remains wielded and is being actively utilized (just holding it at your side doesn’t count). If the weapon is stowed or knocked out of the user’s hand, their Initiative decreases by the appropriate amount. Unless installed onto a Variable Scope Mount, this is incompatible with all other scope based attachments.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Scopes &amp; Sights).</em></p>"
